{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Trigonometric.Deriv","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.ExpDeriv","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Matrix.Mul","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":105,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.deformation_V","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.deformation_V","kind":"theorem","line":505,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L505-L509","doc":"**Deformation Laplacian kills V.** `Δ_H V − 2 Ric V = 0`: under the\nEbin–Marsden / Taylor convention `ν·2 div Def u`, the viscous term on `V`\nvanishes. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:reeb-beltrami-regular-flow","label":"prop:reeb-beltrami-regular-flow","md":"quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/reeb-beltrami-regular-flow.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.weitzenbock_V","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.weitzenbock_V","kind":"theorem","line":500,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L500-L503","doc":"**Weitzenböck check on `V`.** `∇*∇V + Ric V = curl curl V`. The Hodge\nLaplacian of the divergence-free field `V` equals rough plus Ricci. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.rough_V","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.rough_V","kind":"theorem","line":496,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L496-L498","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.ric_X","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.ric_X","kind":"theorem","line":491,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L491-L494","doc":"Ricci on `X` (Milnor: `2μ₂μ₃ = −1 − s²/2`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.ric_V","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.ric_V","kind":"theorem","line":487,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L487-L489","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.curl_curl_V","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.curl_curl_V","kind":"theorem","line":484,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L484-L485","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.curl_V","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.curl_V","kind":"theorem","line":480,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L480-L482","doc":"**Beltrami.** `curl V = −s V`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.nab_VV","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.nab_VV","kind":"theorem","line":477,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L477-L478","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.nab_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.nab_eq","kind":"theorem","line":470,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L470-L475","doc":"Closed form of the Koszul connection (the `/s²` cancels). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.X_not_killing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.X_not_killing","kind":"theorem","line":464,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L464-L468","doc":"Non-vacuity of `V_killing`: `ad_X` is never skew (the defect is `1 + s²`),\nso the left-invariant field `X` is not Killing and the property is specific\nto `V`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.V_killing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.V_killing","kind":"theorem","line":459,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L459-L462","doc":"`V` is Killing: `ad_V` is skew for `g`, so right translations by `exp(tV)`\nare isometries. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.nab_metric","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.nab_metric","kind":"theorem","line":455,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L455-L457","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.nab_torsion_free","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.nab_torsion_free","kind":"theorem","line":452,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L452-L453","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.curl","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.curl","kind":"def","line":444,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L444-L448","doc":"`curl z` for left-invariant `z`: `(curl z)♭ = ⋆ d z♭` with `d z♭(u,v) = −g(z,[u,v])`.\nIts frame components are `(dz♭(e₂,e₃), dz♭(e₃,e₁), dz♭(e₁,e₂))`, for orientation\n`(X, Y, V)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.rough","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.rough","kind":"def","line":437,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L437-L442","doc":"Rough Laplacian `∇*∇ z = −Σᵢ (∇_{eᵢ}∇_{eᵢ} z − ∇_{∇_{eᵢ}eᵢ} z)` on left-invariant `z`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.ric","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.ric","kind":"def","line":433,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L433-L435","doc":"Ricci operator `Ric(z) = Σᵢ R(z, eᵢ) eᵢ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.curv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.curv","kind":"def","line":429,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L429-L431","doc":"Curvature `R(u,v)w = ∇_u∇_v w − ∇_v∇_u w − ∇_{[u,v]} w`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.e3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.e3","kind":"def","line":426,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L426-L427","doc":"Orthonormal frame `e₁ = X, e₂ = Y, e₃ = V/s`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.nab","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.nab","kind":"def","line":423,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L423-L424","doc":"Levi-Civita connection on left-invariant fields, solved from Koszul. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.K","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.K","kind":"def","line":420,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L420-L421","doc":"Koszul expression `⟨∇_u v, w⟩` for left-invariant fields. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.g","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.g","kind":"def","line":417,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L417-L418","doc":"Left-invariant metric: `X, Y` orthonormal, `|V| = s`, all orthogonal. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.eV","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.eV","kind":"def","line":413,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L413-L413","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.eY","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.eY","kind":"def","line":412,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L412-L412","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.eX","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.eX","kind":"def","line":411,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L411-L411","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.toMat_br","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.toMat_br","kind":"theorem","line":406,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L406-L409","doc":"`br` is the matrix commutator, so the coefficient bracket is the bracket of `sl₂`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.br","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.br","kind":"def","line":403,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L403-L404","doc":"Lie bracket in the basis `(X, Y, V)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.smul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.smul","kind":"def","line":401,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L401-L401","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.sub","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.sub","kind":"def","line":400,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L400-L400","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.add","kind":"def","line":399,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L399-L399","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.toMat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.toMat","kind":"def","line":397,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L397-L397","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.c","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.c","kind":"def","line":393,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L393-L393","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.b","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.b","kind":"def","line":392,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L392-L392","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.a","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.a","kind":"def","line":391,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L391-L391","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.mk","kind":"ctor","line":390,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L390-L390","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.ext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.ext","kind":"theorem","line":390,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L390-L390","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.ext_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3.ext_iff","kind":"theorem","line":390,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L390-L390","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.L3","kind":"structure","line":389,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L389-L393","doc":"Coefficients `(a, b, c)` of `aX + bY + cV`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.sl2_brackets","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.sl2_brackets","kind":"theorem","line":384,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L384-L387","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.Vm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.Vm","kind":"def","line":382,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L382-L382","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.Ym","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.Ym","kind":"def","line":381,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L381-L381","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.Xm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.Xm","kind":"def","line":379,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L379-L380","doc":"`X = H/2` (geodesic flow), `Y = (E+F)/2`, `V = (E−F)/2` (fibre rotation). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.abc_nonzero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.abc_nonzero","kind":"theorem","line":372,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L372-L373","doc":"Non-vacuity: the ABC field with `A = B = C = 1` is not identically zero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.abc_periodic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.abc_periodic","kind":"theorem","line":359,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L359-L370","doc":"The ABC field is `2π`-periodic in each variable, so it descends to `T³`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.abc_ns_exact","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.abc_ns_exact","kind":"theorem","line":350,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L350-L357","doc":"**ABC is an exact global NS solution.** For every `ν, A, B, C`,\n`U(t) = e^{−νt} u_ABC` with `P(t) = −e^{−2νt}|u_ABC|²/2` solves incompressible\nNavier–Stokes at every `(t, x, y, z) ∈ ℝ⁴`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.abc_slices","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.abc_slices","kind":"theorem","line":344,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L344-L348","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.abc_lap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.abc_lap","kind":"theorem","line":331,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L331-L342","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.abc_div","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.abc_div","kind":"theorem","line":328,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L328-L329","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.abc_beltrami","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.abc_beltrami","kind":"theorem","line":322,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L322-L326","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.pz_abc₃","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.pz_abc₃","kind":"theorem","line":319,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L319-L320","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.py_abc₃","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.py_abc₃","kind":"theorem","line":317,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L317-L318","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.px_abc₃","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.px_abc₃","kind":"theorem","line":315,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L315-L316","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.pz_abc₂","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.pz_abc₂","kind":"theorem","line":313,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L313-L314","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.py_abc₂","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.py_abc₂","kind":"theorem","line":311,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L311-L312","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.px_abc₂","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.px_abc₂","kind":"theorem","line":309,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L309-L310","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.pz_abc₁","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.pz_abc₁","kind":"theorem","line":307,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L307-L308","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.py_abc₁","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.py_abc₁","kind":"theorem","line":305,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L305-L306","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.px_abc₁","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.px_abc₁","kind":"theorem","line":303,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L303-L304","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.d_sin","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.d_sin","kind":"theorem","line":299,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L299-L300","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.d_neg_sin","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.d_neg_sin","kind":"theorem","line":297,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L297-L298","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.d_cos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.d_cos","kind":"theorem","line":295,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L295-L296","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.d_add_cos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.d_add_cos","kind":"theorem","line":293,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L293-L294","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.d_sin_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.d_sin_add","kind":"theorem","line":291,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L291-L292","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.abc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.abc","kind":"def","line":288,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L288-L289","doc":"The Arnold–Beltrami–Childress field. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.abc₃","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.abc₃","kind":"def","line":286,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L286-L286","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.abc₂","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.abc₂","kind":"def","line":285,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L285-L285","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.abc₁","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.abc₁","kind":"def","line":284,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L284-L284","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.beltrami_eigen_ns","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.beltrami_eigen_ns","kind":"theorem","line":241,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L241-L276","doc":"**Exact NS from a Beltrami eigenfield.** Let `u` be divergence-free, Beltrami\n(`curl u = λu`), with `Δuᵢ = −μ uᵢ`. Then `U(t) = e^{−νμt} u`,\n`P(t) = −e^{−2νμt}|u|²/2` solves incompressible Navier–Stokes exactly on\nℝₜ × ℝ³. The nonlinear term is balanced by the pressure, and the viscous term\nby the time derivative. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.deriv_exp_decay","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.deriv_exp_decay","kind":"theorem","line":234,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L234-L239","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.IsNS","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.IsNS","kind":"def","line":229,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L229-L232","doc":"`U` with pressure `P` is an exact incompressible NS solution on ℝ⁴ = ℝₜ × ℝ³. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.nsRes₃","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.nsRes₃","kind":"def","line":225,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L225-L227","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.nsRes₂","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.nsRes₂","kind":"def","line":222,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L222-L224","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.nsRes₁","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.nsRes₁","kind":"def","line":217,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L217-L221","doc":"Navier–Stokes residuals of a time-dependent field `U` with pressure `P`:\n`∂ₜUᵢ + (U·∇)Uᵢ + ∂ᵢP − ν ΔUᵢ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.lap_const_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.lap_const_mul","kind":"theorem","line":206,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L206-L215","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.pz_const_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.pz_const_mul","kind":"theorem","line":202,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L202-L204","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.py_const_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.py_const_mul","kind":"theorem","line":199,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L199-L201","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.px_const_mul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.px_const_mul","kind":"theorem","line":196,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L196-L198","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.VField.smul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.VField.smul","kind":"def","line":192,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L192-L194","doc":"Scaling a field by a constant. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.beltrami_steady_euler","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.beltrami_steady_euler","kind":"theorem","line":174,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L174-L186","doc":"**Steady Euler.** A divergence-free Beltrami field solves steady Euler,\n`(u·∇)u + ∇p = 0` and `div u = 0`, with `p = −|u|²/2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.beltrami_adv_grad","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.beltrami_adv_grad","kind":"theorem","line":164,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L164-L172","doc":"For a Beltrami field the advection is a pure gradient: `(u·∇)u = ∇(|u|²/2)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.lamb₃","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.lamb₃","kind":"theorem","line":159,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L159-L162","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.lamb₂","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.lamb₂","kind":"theorem","line":154,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/BeltramiSteadyEuler.lean#L154-L157","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.BeltramiSteadyEuler.lamb₁","@type":"LeanDeclaration","